{"surah":81,"ayahs":["إِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّمْسُ كُوِّرَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نُّ</span>جُومُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نكَ</span>دَرَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجِبَالُ سُيِّرَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعِشَارُ عُطِّلَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْوُحُوشُ حُشِرَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبِحَارُ سُجِّرَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نُّ</span>فُوسُ زُوِّجَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَوْءُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span>دَةُ سُئِلَتْ","بِأَىِّ ذَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">نۢبٍ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\"> قُ</span>تِلَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صُّحُفُ نُشِرَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءُ كُشِطَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجَحِيمُ سُعِّرَتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ةُ أُزْلِفَتْ","عَلِمَتْ نَفْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">سٌ </span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَّآ</span> أَحْضَرَتْ","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَآ</span> أُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>سِمُ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_w